          "text": "An amphibious vehicle can move directly forward only over otherwise impassible deep water at half speed by means of an Advance action. A vehicle cannot make any other action whilst moving over water - it cannot reverse, cannot turn, and will ignore all rules that otherwise oblige it to reverse or go Down. A vehicle that is immobilised whilst in the water is destroyed along with any occupants. Vehicles can shoot whilst afloat accept hull mounted weapons on vehicles equipped with floatation screen"
